Error [E0201]: `consume` needs the move marker `^` here — this value can't be copied
  --> tests/ui/take_required.jet:9:13
    |
  9 |     consume(n)
    |             ^
 Why: Parameter 1 takes ownership through the move marker `^`; passing `n` without that marker would have to copy it, but this type can't be copied
 Fix: Write the move marker `^` (`^n`) to move ownership to `consume`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0201
